{"type": "log", "args": ["🚀 ~ handleReturnInfo ~ data:", {"userId": "1615", "cardId": "1960560586298163202", "address": "上海市青浦区虹桥世界中心E幢3楼301室", "email": "shaokunlun@freeuuu.com", "ipArea": "上海市", "mobile": "17681122808", "name": "邵昆仑测试环境", "nativePlace": {"provinceCode": "31", "province": "上海市", "cityCode": "3101", "city": "市辖区", "areaCode": "310120", "area": "奉贤区"}, "personalIntroduction": "暮色织就的薄纱里🌙，晚餐是幅淡墨晕染的小画🎨，慢嚼细咽间，方知烟火人间藏着的回甘悠长🍵。我总与温暖的书籍作伴📚，在墨香氤氲里捡拾生活的碎片，拼凑出细碎却闪光的美好✨。咖啡是位温柔的信使☕，教会我笑着踏过光阴的褶皱，不辜负每一寸流金岁月，也不负那个努力绽放的自己💃。  \n\n用心对待生活的每个瞬间，才能在寻常巷陌里收获不期而遇的轻松惊喜✨。每日以旋律为笺🎵，书写日常的温柔注脚，让平凡的日子开出诗意的花🌸。偶尔，我偏爱与文字对坐，在字缝间打捞璀璨星光🌟，让疲惫的灵魂在墨香里轻轻呼吸🌙。", "tag1": "上海福芮柚科技有限公司", "tag2": "测试", "wechat": "17681122808", "backUpUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/public/card/template/B-B8.png", "avatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/stag/20251205/8c5377eea4f77e6b92207929d13a552f08e2d58145d7a6e04b4182f84ece5b39.jpg", "portraitUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/prod/portrait/20251130/3f67ba0bf35af9dec38ede306e0ecc3b933db966a7c6bb9404cd8bcfca8b9653.png", "nativePlaceName": ["上海市", "市辖区", "奉贤区"], "exchangeStatus": -1, "isMine": 1, "memberStatus": false, "templateId": "9", "styleId": "80", "shareId": "76", "cardIdentityType": 22, "currentIdentityId": "1967970973896331266", "shareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260201/1a2d2d7e5b48ab28e16972d8b2f50b879b73b7da7886798adde3e45d76d3ff16.png", "isEditable": 1, "cardType": 10, "isSendCard": 0, "pendingExchangeId": null}], "dt": "2026-02-02 05:06:17"}
